  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>쇼<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>허<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pzj64WBkoOA?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>今夜<rt>긴ˉ야ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>風雨<rt>헝ˉ우ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>飄飄<rt>ᄑᆤˉᄑᆤˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>離<rt>리ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kīn-yā hōng-ù phiāu-phiāu-loh-boe-lī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>陣陣<rt>준준-</rt></ruby><ruby>雨聲<rt>허샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>滴滴<rt>딯ˆ딯</rt></ruby> <ruby>帶<rt>대ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>情意<rt>졩이</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jun-jun-hor-siâ̰ tîh-tih tài-jieng-i\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>熱戀<rt>뗻롼-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>天氣<rt>틸ˉ키</rt></ruby> <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>今夜<rt>긴ˉ야ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>暗暝<rt>암ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    riet-loan-sí’e thḭ̄-khi chīn-chiṵ-kīn-yā’e àm-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>小雨<rt>쇼ˆ허ˉ</rt></ruby> 앟 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>곻<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siô-hōr ah lì kâm-kôh-e-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>提起<rt>테키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>初戀<rt>처ˉ롼ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>寫批<rt>샤ˆ풰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"hît\">彼<rt>힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>支<rt>기ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>筆<rt>빋</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    the-khî-chōr-loán siâ-phuê hît-kī-pit\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>輕輕<rt>킨ˉ킨ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>寫<rt>샤ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一句<rt>짇구</rt></ruby> &#8220;<ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>愛<rt>애</rt></ruby>’릐&#8221;\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khīn-khīn-siâ-chût-jit-ku “goà ai’li”\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>奈<rt>내-</rt></ruby><ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>全部<rt>좐버-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>是<rt>시ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>今夜<rt>긴ˉ야ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>風雨<rt>헝ˉ허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>創治<rt>청ˋ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-nai-jè joan-por-sī, kīn-yā hōng-hōr lêh-chòng-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>小雨<rt>쇼ˆ허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>引<rt>인ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꾼<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>想<rt>슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’키릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siô-hōr în-gùn siṵ̄’khi-li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>意義<rt>이ˋ끼ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>就<rt>쥬-</rt></ruby><ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>分離<rt>훈ˉ리ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>開始<rt>캐ˉ시ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kâm-kông-sū-liām’e ì-gī, jiu-si-hūn-lī’e khāi-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span cla